<noinclude>
Infobox and Cargo row for a species. Create pages with [[Form:Species]].
Each system it exists in is a [[Template:Species system]] row inside <code>in_systems</code>, which sets the lists the stat blocks pick from.
[[Module:Species]] lists each system once, and flags repeats in [[:Category:Species with repeated systems]].

Pages still using the old <code>systems</code> and <code>playable</code> lists keep their categories,
and are listed in [[:Category:Species to convert]] until they're saved with the form.

{{#cargo_declare:_table=Species
|image=File
|summary=Text
}}

